Why is NumPy Faster - 
1. Faster to read less bytes of memory - 
2. No type checking when iterating through objects
3. NumPy has contiguos memory blocks unlike list where there memory allocation can be scattered.
    SIMD vector processing - single instruction multiple data
    effective cache utilization

